			<p>Hello</p>

			<p>We are pleased that you have Accepted {User_Core_Leads_Accepted_Current_Year__c}&nbsp;new leads and have Contacted {User_Core_Leads_Contacted_Current_Year__c} of those this year generated through our Intel® Partner Alliance program.</p>

			<p>As we’re continually improving our lead generation tactics, we’d love to learn more about the status of these leads!</p>

